VITE_CORS_PROXY=

 To deploy your own CORS proxy (free, takes 2 minutes):
#
# 1. Sign up at https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up/workers-and-pages (free, no credit card)
#
# 2. Install the CLI:
#    npm install -g wrangler
#
# 3. Login (opens browser):
#    npx wrangler login
#
# 4. Deploy from the worker/ folder:
#    cd worker
#    npx wrangler deploy
#
# 5. Copy the URL it gives you (something like):
#    https://your-worker-name.your-subdomain.workers.dev
#
# 6. Set it here with /?url= at the end:
#    VITE_CORS_PROXY=https://your-worker-name.your-subdomain.workers.dev/?url=
#
# 7. Rebuild:
#    npm run build
